    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>STORY:</strong></h2>Fred's car breaks down in the middle of a forest, forcing him to seek help. But he soon discovers that something else is going on. Your goal in this text-based choice game is to help the protagonist survive until he uncovers the mysteries of this place and reunites with his daughter, Susan.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3186200/extras/546e04c699e0f59831f625a5977a5fee.avif?t=1736264161\" width=598 height=332 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>6+ DIFFERENT ENDINGS</strong></h2>There are many paths that you can choose and lead to more than 6 different endings. Some good and others bad.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3186200/extras/a0bb4e669f71533fe96477d1ab573055.avif?t=1736264161\" width=598 height=336 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>IMMERSIVE GAMEPLAY</strong></h2>Many places to visit with images of all the regions of the game. Gameplay full of sounds for better fill the ambience and what is happening at the momment.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SURVIVAL MECHANICS</strong></h2>You are controlling a person, keep that in mind if you want Fred to survive his journey. With health and hunger meters, mainten then filled up by using itens from your inventory.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3186200/extras/b0220e825b3dfd6778fa99a9a1424c49.poster.avif?t=1736264161\" width=600 height=332 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3186200/extras/b0220e825b3dfd6778fa99a9a1424c49.webm?t=1736264161\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3186200/extras/b0220e825b3dfd6778fa99a9a1424c49.mp4?t=1736264161\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FULL TRANSLATION TO ENGLISH AND PORTUGUESE</strong></h2>The game contains full translation for both english and brazilian portuguese. And plans for even more languages in the future!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3186200/extras/bd5dc3b25af6ca1131a729557f6b91a6.poster.avif?t=1736264161\" width=600 height=332 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3186200/extras/bd5dc3b25af6ca1131a729557f6b91a6.webm?t=1736264161\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3186200/extras/bd5dc3b25af6ca1131a729557f6b91a6.mp4?t=1736264161\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>STORY:</strong></h2>Fred's car breaks down in the middle of a forest, forcing him to seek help. But he soon discovers that something else is going on. Your goal in this text-based choice game is to help the protagonist survive until he uncovers the mysteries of this place and reunites with his daughter, Susan.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3186200/extras/546e04c699e0f59831f625a5977a5fee.avif?t=1736264161\" width=598 height=332 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>6+ DIFFERENT ENDINGS</strong></h2>There are many paths that you can choose and lead to more than 6 different endings. Some good and others bad.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3186200/extras/a0bb4e669f71533fe96477d1ab573055.avif?t=1736264161\" width=598 height=336 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>IMMERSIVE GAMEPLAY</strong></h2>Many places to visit with images of all the regions of the game. Gameplay full of sounds for better fill the ambience and what is happening at the momment.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SURVIVAL MECHANICS</strong></h2>You are controlling a person, keep that in mind if you want Fred to survive his journey. With health and hunger meters, mainten then filled up by using itens from your inventory.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3186200/extras/b0220e825b3dfd6778fa99a9a1424c49.poster.avif?t=1736264161\" width=600 height=332 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3186200/extras/b0220e825b3dfd6778fa99a9a1424c49.webm?t=1736264161\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3186200/extras/b0220e825b3dfd6778fa99a9a1424c49.mp4?t=1736264161\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FULL TRANSLATION TO ENGLISH AND PORTUGUESE</strong></h2>The game contains full translation for both english and brazilian portuguese. And plans for even more languages in the future!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3186200/extras/bd5dc3b25af6ca1131a729557f6b91a6.poster.avif?t=1736264161\" width=600 height=332 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3186200/extras/bd5dc3b25af6ca1131a729557f6b91a6.webm?t=1736264161\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3186200/extras/bd5dc3b25af6ca1131a729557f6b91a6.mp4?t=1736264161\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
